      "properties": {
        "entityId": "cao-wei",
        "startDate": "0199-06-01",
        "endDate": "0201-09-30",
        "order": 5,
        "segmentType": "counterattack",
        "name": {
          "zh": "许昌—官渡—乌巢—仓亭—许昌（官渡与仓亭）",
          "en": "Xuchang–Guandu–Wuchao–Cangting–Xuchang (Guandu and Cangting)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "建安四年（199）六月袁绍选精兵十万南进，曹操分兵守官渡；建安五年（200）十月曹操亲率步骑五千夜袭乌巢，烧其粮草，袁军崩溃。建安六年（201）春曹操就谷于安民，四月扬兵河上、击破袁绍仓亭军，九月还许都。原线止于乌巢，线尾无后续；此处补仓亭与还许，构成完整往返。仓亭取今山东阳谷一带代表点，标 approx。",
          "en": "In the sixth month of 199 Yuan Shao moved south with 100,000 picked troops and Cao Cao divided his forces to hold Guandu. In the tenth month of 200 Cao Cao led 5,000 horse and foot on a night raid on Wuchao, burned Yuan’s grain and broke his army. In the spring of 201 Cao Cao took grain at Anmin, in the fourth month displayed his army on the Yellow River and destroyed Yuan Shao’s Cangting force, and in the ninth month returned to Xuchang. The former line stopped at Wuchao with no follow-through; Cangting and the return are now added. Cangting is represented by the Yanggu area of Shandong and marked approx."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic",
          "locationPrecision": "approx"
        }
