      "properties": {
        "entityId": "cao-wei",
        "startDate": "0208-07-01",
        "endDate": "0208-12-31",
        "order": 10,
        "segmentType": "naval",
        "name": {
          "zh": "许昌—新野—襄阳—江陵—赤壁（南征荆州）",
          "en": "Xuchang–Xinye–Xiangyang–Jiangling–Chibi (campaign in Jingzhou)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "建安十三年（208）七月曹操南下征荆州；八月刘表卒，九月曹军至新野，刘琮举州投降，曹操轻骑追击刘备于当阳长坂，随后进占江陵，得刘表水军，顺江东下至赤壁。原线由许都直连江陵，把襄阳、新野一段省掉，导致追击段（襄阳—当阳）的线头悬空；此处补新野、襄阳两点。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the seventh month of 208 Cao Cao marched south against Jingzhou. Liu Biao died in the eighth month; in the ninth month Cao’s army reached Xinye, Liu Cong surrendered the province, Cao’s light cavalry pursued Liu Bei to Changban at Dangyang, and he then occupied Jiangling, took over Liu Biao’s river fleet and moved east down the Yangtze to Chibi. The former line ran straight from Xuchang to Jiangling, omitting the Xinye–Xiangyang stretch and leaving the pursuit route without a head; both points are now added. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
