        "order": 12,
        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "襄阳—当阳长坂（轻骑追击）",
          "en": "Xiangyang–Changban (light cavalry pursuit)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "建安十三年（208）九月曹操至襄阳，闻刘备南走，弃辎重，率精骑五千急追，一日一夜行三百余里，在当阳长坂追上并击溃刘备部众；刘备弃妻子，与诸葛亮、张飞、赵云等数十骑走汉津，会关羽水军退往夏口。此段线头接南征主线（许都—新野—襄阳），线尾由长坂事件承接。",
          "en": "In the ninth month of 208 Cao Cao reached Xiangyang and, learning that Liu Bei had fled south, abandoned his baggage and led 5,000 picked cavalry in pursuit, covering over 300 li in a day and a night, catching and routing Liu Bei’s force at Changban in Dangyang. Liu Bei abandoned his family and fled with Zhuge Liang, Zhang Fei, Zhao Yun and a few dozen riders to Hanjin, where he joined Guan Yu’s flotilla and withdrew to Xiakou. The head now joins the main southern campaign and the tail is anchored by the Changban event."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
