      "properties": {
        "entityId": "cao-wei",
        "startDate": "0249-01-01",
        "endDate": "0249-02-28",
        "order": 26,
        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "洛阳—高平陵—洛阳（高平陵之变）",
          "en": "Luoyang–Gaopingling–Luoyang (Gaopingling coup)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "魏正始十年（249）正月，曹爽兄弟陪魏帝曹芳出洛阳谒高平陵；司马懿乘机在洛阳发动政变，闭城门、占武库、控制禁军，并派人劝曹爽归降。曹爽回洛阳后交出兵权，旋被族诛，司马氏专权自此始。原线止于高平陵，线尾无后续；此处补回洛阳一段。高平陵取洛阳以南代表点，标 approx。",
          "en": "In the first month of 249 Cao Shuang and his brothers accompanied Emperor Cao Fang out of Luoyang to sacrifice at Gaopingling. Sima Yi seized the moment to stage a coup in Luoyang, closing the gates, seizing the arsenal and controlling the palace guards, then sent envoys to persuade Cao Shuang to submit. Cao Shuang returned to Luoyang, gave up his command and was soon executed with his clan, beginning Sima family rule. The former line ended at Gaopingling with no follow-through; the return to Luoyang is now added. Gaopingling is represented by a point south of Luoyang and marked approx."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic",
          "locationPrecision": "approx"
        }
