        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "武昌—皖口（孙权进驻皖口）",
          "en": "Wuchang–Wankou (Sun Quan moves to Wankou)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "黄武七年（228）五月周鲂诈降诱曹休，八月孙权自武昌进驻皖口（今安庆山口乡），命陆逊迎击。原皖口坐标偏西约 50 公里，已改正。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the fifth month of 228 Zhou Fang lured Cao Xiu with a feigned surrender; in the eighth month Sun Quan moved from Wuchang to Wankou (modern Shankou, Anqing) and sent Lu Xun against him. The former Wankou coordinate lay about 50 km west and has been corrected. The line is schematic."
        },
