        "order": 33,
        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "公安—武昌（孙权迁都）",
          "en": "Gong’an–Wuchang (Sun Quan moves the capital)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "建安二十六年（221）四月，孙权自公安迁都鄂县，改名武昌，以武昌、下雉、寻阳、阳新、柴桑、沙羡六县置武昌郡，以拒刘备东下。至黄龙元年（229）还都建业。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the fourth month of 221 Sun Quan moved his capital from Gong’an to E county, renamed it Wuchang, and created Wuchang commandery from six counties including Wuchang, Xiazhi, Xunyang, Yangxin, Chaisang and Shaxian, to face Liu Bei’s eastward advance. In 229 he returned the capital to Jianye. The line is schematic."
        },
